                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Fish, Secretary of
                        State, to Mr. Pierrepont, district
                        attorney.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <dateline><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi
                            rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                        calendar="gregorian" when="1869-06-26"><hi rendition="#italic">June</hi> 26,
                        1869</date>.</dateline>
                <p rendition="#flush">Hon. <hi rendition="#small-caps">Edwards Pierrepont</hi>, <hi
                        rendition="#italic">District Attorney, New York:</hi></p>
                <p><seg type="margin">[70]</seg> The marshal and his officers will be sustained *in
                    their duties at all hazards. Instructions by mail this afternoon. Get the
                    letter.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>HAMILTON FISH.</signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
